{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e04-scene-23",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "冠名饮料摆错了  (The Wrong Sponsor Drink on Set)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "wen_simo": "闻思默",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Seconds before the Star Night gala opens, Chun Yuqiao's sharp eye catches a major sponsor mistake on the red-carpet tables: bottles from a competing water brand! Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "台上的冠名饮料摆错了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "两家水包装很像，但是他们是竞争对手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "马上通知台里，红毯现场出了点问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "本届的星光盛典由卫视和星天共同为您呈现。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "在这里有最强的明星阵容，也有最广的热点资讯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "一年一度的盛典将在今晚为您完全呈现。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "让现场的人马上上去，把摆错的水给我撤了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "真的摆错了，来来来，大家快撤走！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，台上的水全都撤干净了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "收到，继续盯着直播。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "台上的冠名饮料摆错了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The title-sponsor drinks onstage are the wrong brand.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "两家水包装很像，但是他们是竞争对手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The two water bottles look alike, yet the companies are direct competitors.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "马上通知台里，红毯现场出了点问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Notify the network immediately that there is an issue at the red carpet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "本届的星光盛典由卫视和星天共同为您呈现。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This year's Star Night gala is jointly presented by the network and Xingtian.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "在这里有最强的明星阵容，也有最广的热点资讯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here we have the strongest celebrity lineup and the widest entertainment news.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "一年一度的盛典将在今晚为您完全呈现。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This annual gala celebration will be presented to you in full tonight.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "让现场的人马上上去，把摆错的水给我撤了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Send floor staff up right now and clear the wrong bottled water off for me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "真的摆错了，来来来，大家快撤走！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They really set out the wrong ones; come on everyone, clear them fast!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，台上的水全都撤干净了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, all the wrong bottles onstage have been cleared away.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "收到，继续盯着直播。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Copy that; keep watching the live feed.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "台上的冠名饮料摆错了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "两家水包装很像，但是他们是竞争对手。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "马上通知台里，红毯现场出了点问题。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "本届的星光盛典由卫视和星天共同为您呈现。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "在这里有最强的明星阵容，也有最广的热点资讯。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "一年一度的盛典将在今晚为您完全呈现。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "让现场的人马上上去，把摆错的水给我撤了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "真的摆错了，来来来，大家快撤走！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，台上的水全都撤干净了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "收到，继续盯着直播。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Yuqiao and Kaiwen clear every wrong bottle off the set right before the live cameras sweep across the stage. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
